Up to Beta 7.5, Glyde was a vanilla monster with a massive 10/10 in stats for the cost of 12G. '''Beta 7.5''' dropped that to 11G, and '''Beta 7.6''' dropped it further to 10G.
[[File:Glyde (Beta 7.6).png|thumb|234x234px|Beta 7.6]]
This stayed for quite a while again, but not as long, as '''Beta 30.0''' gave it a complete rework. Its cost dropped further to 7G, but its stats of 10/10 drastically dropped to a mere 2/2. However, it now got an effect, which gives it +1/+1 for each card in your hand when played. This made Glyde work identical to an old version of [https://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Lemon_Bread Lemon Bread] (from Alpha 2.7 to be exact). Lemon Bread's next buff (in Beta 6.5) passed onto Glyde as well, as '''Beta 31.0''' buffed Glyde with an even lower cost of 6G.
[[File:Glyde (Beta 30.0).png|thumb|238x238px|Beta 30.0]]

